## SECTION 3: 3D-PRINTABLE MECHANICAL ENCLOSURE & MAGNETIC CLAMP SPECIFICATIONS

- **Overall Envelope**: $72.0\text{ mm} \times 44.0\text{ mm} \times 24.5\text{ mm}$ (Fits inside standard 1U server chassis).
- **Filament**: Mandated **ABS or ASA** ($T_g = 105^\circ\text{C}$, HDT $98^\circ\text{C}$). PLA is strictly banned due to server exhaust thermal creep ($50-65^\circ\text{C}$).
- **Clamping**: 4x N52 Neodymium Disc Magnets ($15\text{ mm} \times 3\text{ mm}$) arranged in Halbach North-South array, providing $54\text{ N}$ ($5.5\text{ kgf}$) holding force.
- **Acoustic Coupling**: $1.0\text{ mm}$ Shore A 35 Fluoroelastomer (Viton/FKM) dry pad ($Z \approx 1.52\text{ MRayl}$). Zero messy gels, zero residue.

